              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Different but good. Almost like a lime Diet Coke, but only fresher and with a kick. I doubled the vodka because I like my drinks stronger. If I make this again, and I will, I'd add just a skotch of fresh squeezed lime and lemon juice. Just to give it a tartness in the mouth."
          },
