            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I'm giving this a three because in my haste to make this drink, I didn't realize it was pretty much just vodka and club soda. Otherwise it would be a one star. I had high hopes for the cola and lime juice (added per other reviews) but this drink was straight club soda. Go Lambchop for doubling the vodka! I added some sweetened lime juice after the fact and a bit more coke. I'll stick with my watered down vodka sours. Light and lemony. Mmmm.",
